# game/script.rpy:52
translate schinese ep1_start_label_47544b69:

    # "Family."
    "家人。"

# game/script.rpy:53
translate schinese ep1_start_label_2b306369:

    # "My dad once told me that a family is more than blood relations."
    "我爸曾经告诉我，家人不只是血缘关系。"

# game/script.rpy:54
translate schinese ep1_start_label_85d1a7c5:

    # "Being related doesn't necessarily make you family."
    "有血缘，未必就是家人。"

# game/script.rpy:55
translate schinese ep1_start_label_83f65ce8:

    # "Family are the people who support you in your choices."
    "家人，是支持你做出选择的人。"

# game/script.rpy:56
translate schinese ep1_start_label_095b1f1b:

    # "Family will help you grow."
    "家人，会帮助你成长。"

# game/script.rpy:57
translate schinese ep1_start_label_10862016:

    # "Family doesn't give up on you in times of need."
    "家人，不会在你最需要的时候放弃你。"

# game/script.rpy:58
translate schinese ep1_start_label_02f13c29:

    # "Family are the ones who love you for you..."
    "家人，是爱着你本来模样的人……"

# game/script.rpy:59
translate schinese ep1_start_label_832beedd:

    # "...whoever that may be."
    "……无论你是什么样的人。"

# game/script.rpy:60
translate schinese ep1_start_label_f6de9984:

    # "Even if you lose your family..."
    "即使你失去了家人……"

# game/script.rpy:61
translate schinese ep1_start_label_3fc9fcfc:

    # "...or if your family loses you."
    "……或者家人失去了你。"

# game/script.rpy:62
translate schinese ep1_start_label_a8745437:

    # "Don't stop."
    "也不要停下脚步。"

# game/script.rpy:63
translate schinese ep1_start_label_bb98bc1a:

    # "Find new ones to love and somewhere else to call home."
    "去找到新的所爱之人，找到另一个可以称之为家的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:67
translate schinese ep1_start_label_3ccca585:

    # "That's me and my dad."
    "这就是我和我爸。"

# game/script.rpy:68
translate schinese ep1_start_label_3a5f7cab:

    # "We took that photo the day I got my driver's license."
    "这张照片，是在我拿到驾照那天拍的。"

# game/script.rpy:69
translate schinese ep1_start_label_53a54667:

    # "He was so happy that it looks like he is trying to swallow a coat hanger."
    "他当时高兴坏了，笑得像是想把衣架吞下去。"

# game/script.rpy:70
translate schinese ep1_start_label_3065b624:

    # "Back then, it was just me and him."
    "那时候，家里只有我和他。"

# game/script.rpy:71
translate schinese ep1_start_label_d5d5e04f:

    # "My mother died shortly after giving birth to me."
    "我妈在生下我不久后就去世了。"

# game/script.rpy:72
translate schinese ep1_start_label_56e65c69:

    # "It's a shame that I never got to meet her."
    "遗憾的是，我从未见过她。"

# game/script.rpy:73
translate schinese ep1_start_label_3b5d9c3e:

    # "I would have loved hearing stories from her past and truly getting to know her."
    "我多想听听她的故事，真正地了解她。"

# game/script.rpy:74
translate schinese ep1_start_label_147ec33a:

    # "Sure, my dad told me stories growing up...but his memory sucked."
    "当然，我爸在我成长过程中讲过不少……但他的记性实在糟糕。"

# game/script.rpy:75
translate schinese ep1_start_label_f07e2aa0:

    # "He would always forget the punchline. Not surprising, since he would talk so long before reaching the point where the punchline was supposed to be."
    "他总是忘掉笑点。这也不奇怪，毕竟他总要绕上一大圈，才讲到该抖包袱的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:76
translate schinese ep1_start_label_b218d564:

    # "Either way, I was happy back then. We didn't have much, we...erm..."
    "不管怎样，那时候我是快乐的。我们并不富裕，我们……呃……"

# game/script.rpy:77
translate schinese ep1_start_label_7ea15384:

    # "...we had enough."
    "……我们也算过得去。"

# game/script.rpy:78
